📊 Database Schema(Vercel KV)
User Data
Key: user: { email }
Fields:
- name: string
    - email: string
        - prompt: 1: "purchased" | "unlocked"
            - purchase_date: 3: ISO timestamp
                - source: "stripe" | "gumroad" | "form"

Referral Data
Key: referral: { userId }
Fields:
- email: string
    - directReferrals: number
        - totalReferrals: number
            - unlocked: boolean
                - referredBy: string(parent userId)


